  "releaseNotes": "v6.0.0: AIService — consolidate GetCompletionAsync (8 overloads → 2 with optional params) and StreamAsync (6 overloads → 4 with optional params). StreamCoreAsync protected virtual introduced for provider-level streaming overrides (DeepSeek, Perplexity). Breaking change: callers using positional AIRequestContext must switch to named parameter.",
